<p>If you want a middle ground, check out the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=hydroponic+starter+kit+under+50&tag=tabletopharve-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored">hydroponic starter kits under $50</a>. They are somewhere between AeroGarden and full DIY. Not as convenient as AeroGarden, not as cheap as a mason jar. But a decent compromise.</p>

